cause each of the three invoices is above EUR 6,000. Please put this text at =
the bottom of the invoice, in English:

"The exporter of the products covered by this document (Approved Exporter Aut=
horisation No. KR-AE-20417) declares that, except where otherwise clearly ind=
icated, these products are of Korean preferential origin."

Please also add the place and date and the name of the signatory. For the cor=
rected invoices of the three shipments I need signed PDFs that keep the origi=
nal invoice numbers, with the statement added. Do you know when the new invoi=
ce template could go live?

