While reviewing our import declarations I found three Pyeongtaek shipments th=
at cleared in Rotterdam on 8 and 9 October without the EU-Korea FTA origin st=
atement on the commercial invoice. Because the proof of origin was missing, c=
ustoms could not apply the preference and charged full duty: EUR 18,400 in to=
tal for the three shipments (details below).

Could you please check why the statement is missing from your export invoices=
? We need two things: (1) a corrected invoice with the origin statement for e=
ach of the three shipments, and (2) the statement on all future invoices. Wit=
hout the corrected invoices I cannot file the refund request. Please tell me =
if you need the exact wording from our side.

Invoice | Delivery | Container | Duty charged (EUR)
INV-48211 | 80456721 | MSKU4417203 | 6,200
INV-48212 | 80456734 | TGHU8820154 | 7,150
INV-48219 | 80456790 | CAIU5539017 | 5,050

